'''Finneon''' (Japanese: '''ケイコウオ''' ''Keikouo'') is a {{ct|Water}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Space-Time Smackdown}} expansion.

